 "remarks": "Enjoy comfortable living in this one-bedroom condo in Norwalk's convenient Flax Hill neighborhood. The spacious living and dining area features a wood-burning fireplace and sliding doors leading to a private balcony with distant views of Long Island Sound. The unit offers central air conditioning, mechanical systems in good condition, and additional storage space. Conveniently located just minutes from the South Norwalk train station, SoNo Collection, restaurants, shopping, parks, and the waterfront, with easy access to I-95 and the Merritt Parkway. A great opportunity to make this space your own while enjoying a convenient location and coastal views.",
